<title>USA: Just Toys says appeals court dismisses case.</title>
<headline>Just Toys says appeals court dismisses case.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just Toys Inc said on Thursday that the U.S. Appeals Court let stand a lower court's decision to dismiss Oddzon's claims that Just Toys' toy footballs infringe upon OddzOn's patent.</p>
<p>Just Toys president and chief executive Barry Shapiro said in a statement, &quot;We are especially gratified by this complete vindication because this has been a long and extremely costly process, taking our time and resources for almost two-and-a-half years.&quot;</p>
</text>
